{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912420/extras/e6fca998ca44bc7180ac3e956598085a.poster.avif?t=1757719041\" aria-label=\"Giant spider attacks the player\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912420/extras/e6fca998ca44bc7180ac3e956598085a.webm?t=1757719041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912420/extras/e6fca998ca44bc7180ac3e956598085a.mp4?t=1757719041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RETURN TO TRAHULARA</strong> is a Stylized, third person sci fi shooter. Chaotic, retro-style shoot and run gameplay, combined with multiple factions of NPC\u2019s that fight each other for survival, with or without your help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run the linear mission based storyline or use the dev-mod panel to create your own freeform battle scenarios, and teleport to whichever space-Island you want to liberate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free the tribal warriors!\u00a0 -\u00a0Release the giant Harvester Spiders! -\u00a0Take control of the enemy droid army!\u00a0 -\u00a0Do whatever it takes to....\u00a0<strong>RETURN TO TRAHULARA</strong>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3912420?t=1757719041","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912420/7c3ca1b7bb1a82ec3ea7733e6b9ad77788ef9796/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757719041","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912420/630635567830c0f55ac6aba138d65bc48078318c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757719041","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912420/630635567830c0f55ac6aba138d65bc48078318c/capsule_184x